--- !u!114 &1713099863
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1713099860}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b6d65564ea6183f4b9be747a6e044fc4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - content: Hey Jackie, connection alright?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084296
    - rid: 2403555690236084297
    - rid: 2403555690236084298
    - rid: 2403555690236084299
    - rid: 2403555690236084300
  - content: Hey Cam! I hear ya.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084301
    - rid: 2403555690236084302
    - rid: 2403555690236084303
    - rid: 2403555690236084304
  - content: "Good, how\u2019s it going out there?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084305
  - content: "Mostly dull. We\u2019re on lockdown, so no \"official\" mining business. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084306
  - content: "<i>But I\u2019ve been getting in some extra scouting at night!</i>"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Jackie, are you insane!? By yourself?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084307
  - content: "Relax. I\u2019ve got your invention. Your glove works like a charm."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084308
  - content: "Besides, I\u2019ve been tracking that Princess Frog. Something\u2019s
      not right about it. It\u2019s too... organized."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084309
  - content: "It\u2019s been hoarding crystals, dragging them deep into the mountains.
      I was planning on getting a closer look."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "<i>Sighs</i> ...Jackie, you can\u2019t just... I swear, what part of
      \"danger\" don\u2019t you get? Just once, could you wait for backup?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084310
  - content: Whatever, <i>mom</i>.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084311
  - content: "Hey, I\u2019m serious! The mountains are a signal dead zone. If something
      happens..."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084312
  - content: Then it happens. Look. The supply refresh is arriving soon anyway.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4550414889271427152
    - rid: 4550414889271427153
  - content: "I heard they\u2019re sending us new serums."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Once they arrive, we\u2019ll be able to go out officially again. I
      won\u2019t have to sneak around for much longer."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...Yeah. About that.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4550414889271427155
    - rid: 2403555690236084315
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084316
  - content: ... I wanted to talk about Ives.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084317
  - content: "Yeah, I heard! She\u2019ll be back. She\u2019s getting better\u2026
      right?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084318
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084319
  - content: ...What? Cam?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084320
  - content: "I\u2019m so sorry Jackie. We couldn\u2019t purge the Waste in time.
      Her condition..."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084321
  - content: "...It\u2019s permanent."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...Permanent?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084322
  - content: "She\u2019ll be on suppressants, so she\u2019ll... she\u2019ll look
      fine. But we\u2019re worried that by returning to the field, the exertion will
      make her feel worse."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084323
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084324
  - content: ...Jackie? You still there?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084325
  - content: "...Yeah. Sorry. That... I just\u2026 <i>Shit</i>."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084326
  - content: <i>Jackie looks to the ground, running a hand through her hair.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4550414889271427156
  - content: "If only I\u2019d been faster. If I\u2019d noticed that damn injection..."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4550414889271427157
    - rid: 2403555690236084327
  - content: "Jackie, no. It wasn\u2019t your fault. If you hadn\u2019t noticed it
      at all, she..."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084328
    - rid: 2403555690236084370
  - content: Cam...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084329
  - content: "Is this\u2026 all even worth it?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084330
  - content: What?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084331
  - content: When I stood there and saw the doctors take Ives away... I had a thought.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084332
  - content: "I... I\u2019ve been trying to catch a ghost for years, dragging everyone
      with me."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: And for what? So I can watch the only family I have left... wither away?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084333
  - content: "It\u2019s happening again. My mom... and now Ives. It feels like...
      I\u2019m losing everything."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Maybe it\u2019s time to just... stop. Cut my losses before anyone else
      gets hurt because of me."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084334
  - content: "That\u2019s not true. Ives made her own choice to fight with you."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084335
  - content: And look where it got her! Look...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084336
  - content: "...Chasing a ghost is getting tiring. I think it\u2019s time to let
      go of the past, Cam."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084337
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084338
  - content: "You\u2019re right. It is tiring."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084339
  - content: "It\u2019s tiring when you think you\u2019re the one dragging us along
      instead of letting us help you."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084340
  - content: "It\u2019s tiring convincing yourself that you\u2019re the only one
      who\u2019s allowed to get hurt."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084341
  - content: "I\u2019m just trying to protect y\u2014"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084342
    - rid: 2403555690236084371
  - content: "No, you\u2019re not."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084343
  - content: "You\u2019re just trying to protect yourself."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Look I get it. My invention... what happened to Ives, I felt the same
      responsibility,
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084344
  - content: "But this isn\u2019t just <i>your</i> quest, Jackie. You talk like you\u2019re
      the only one who lost her. So why..."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084345
  - content: "Why can\u2019t you trust us to help you? To take on this burden together."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084346
  - content: Because that trust... is meaningless.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084347
  - content: What?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084348
  - content: "I trusted my mother. That she was the strongest. And she... she\u2019s
      gone."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084349
  - content: "I trusted that Ives knew what she was doing to help me. And she\u2019s
      going too."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "There\u2019s no guarantees that anyone can make, Cam. So how can I
      trust anyone?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084350
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084351
  - content: "\u2026Finding my mom was my test to <i>prove</i> to her."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084353
  - content: "To prove that I\u2019m strong enough to protect myself now."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084354
  - content: "That I... that I won\u2019t just vanish."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084355
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084356
  - content: "...And who is \"us,\" Cam? Right now. Who\u2019s \u201Cus\u201D out
      here?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084357
  - content: "You\u2019re at the base, stuck in a lab. Ives is... sick. Command has
      \u201Cus\u201D on lockdown."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "I... I hear you. I do. But the reality is, I\u2019m the only one out
      here who can do anything."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084358
  - content: And if I lose that Princess Frog, we lose our only lead.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084359
  - content: Dammit.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "*<i>sigh</i>* Fine\u2026."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "I can\u2019t stop you, can I?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084360
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084361
  - content: "Well if you\u2019re set on going in, you\u2019re not going in there
      blind."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084362
  - content: Yeah...?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084363
  - content: "I\u2019m working on something with the professor. It\u2019s a contingency
      for Ives. And it\u2019s all centered on that Frog."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084364
  - content: "I\u2019m sending a data packet to your glove, right now. It should
      allow you to track its frequency signature when you get closer."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: It should at least give you an edge. Just... just use it. And send me
      your coordinates every time you go.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084365
  - content: ...Okay.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084366
  - content: "We do this together, even when we\u2019re apart. Got it?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084367
  - content: ... Got it. Thanks, Cam.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555690236084368
